<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 585.03, down 0.38.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 261 to 251.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,402,650 compared with 20,579,410 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
